        "description": "Fetches the current Bitcoin price and compares it with every alert. For each alert whose target is **above** the current price, an SMS is sent through Twilio.\n\nAn alert is not notified again within one hour (`cooldown`).\n\nPer-alert `status` values: `notified`, `above_target`, `cooldown`, `failed`.\n\n**Warning:** this sends real SMS messages and may incur Twilio charges."
